#: display-scale@rasmarc/native-scale.py:76
msgid "Screen scaling currently requires exactly one active monitor."
msgstr "현재 화면 확대에는 활성 모니터가 정확히 하나 필요합니다."

#: display-scale@rasmarc/native-scale.py:79
